id: regenerating-beast-second-effect
name: Regenerating Beast
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
encounterLimit: 3
fromTrait: regenerating-beast
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Regenerating Beast's second effect, as a Maneuver: a Healing Surge, none this Round before or after.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round, 3/Encounter]: If you haven’t used a Healing Surge this Combat Round, then as Standard Action with an Action Cost of 1 Action, you may use a Healing Surge. If you do, you cannot use another Healing Surge for the duration of this Combat Round.

---

# Refused with a Healing Surge used this Round; after it, none other this Round (chat.mjs regenerateSurge, takeSurge).
[on used]
regenerateSurge();
